OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits endangering life after
OL,4,Afire at property
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted endangering life by
OL,7,Fsetting fire to a home in Spalding.
OL,9,FFernando Martins, 60, pleaded guilty to
OL,10,Fa charge of arson as being reckless to
OL,11,Fendanger life when he appeared at
OL,12,FLincoln Crown Court earlier.
OL,14,FMartins admitted endangering the life
OL,15,Fof Fernando Garcia by setting a fire at
OL,16,Fthe property in Holbeach Road,
OL,17,FSpalding, on 7 September.
OL,19,FMartins, also of Holbeach Road,
OL,20,FSpalding, has been remanded into
OL,21,Fcustody and is due to be sentenced on
OL,22,F20 November.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
